ce I'm just writing the test script rather than modifying the implementation, I'll focus on capturing the expected error output and exit code. I need to structure the test script to validate each scenario: building the binary, setting up the learning directory, running unit tests, then testing the edge cases where directories don't exist, valid files pass, README gets skipped, bad loops trigger errors, and bad skills cause dream_check to fail.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8dbadfd-c0f1-4a83-b5d3-a9fb5e26143a","uuid":"d3b96fcf-1559-4177-9b7e-07031564d8f6"}
